A GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.4633) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900KF (32 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nUsing the **Visible Ratio** and **Visible Character Behavior** set to `Glyphs (Right-to-Left)` to \"write\" out characters backwards works as expected in 4.2.2.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4d2d043-2773-44c2-bf39-e467bd7c021d)\n\nGodot 4.3 and later will display no characters until the Visible Ratio is 1.0.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b1e8ecb3-0452-4ac6-9376-78c3026f09a0)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Using a RichTextLabel\n2. Change **Visible Characters Behavior** to `Glyphs (Right-to-Left)`\n3. Change **Visible Ratio** to anything below `1.0`\n4. Observe all text is not visible\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rtl-visibility.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19720798/rtl-visibility.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,